<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">In addition to the directors
elected above, Jeffrey Ajer, Robert Chess, Howard W. Robin and Roy Whitfield continue to serve as directors after the Annual Meeting.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

