<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>Proposal 6</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The proposal to approve an
amendment to our Certificate of Incorporation to effect, at the discretion of the Board on or prior to the one-year anniversary of the
date of the Annual Meeting, a reverse stock split of our common stock at a stock split ratio between 1-for-2 and 1-for-40, with the final
ratio to be determined by the Board in its sole discretion, the implementation and timing of which shall be subject to the sole discretion
of the Board was approved with the following votes.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-indent: 0.5in"></p>

